{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-birds-thrive-cities","revision":1,"title_en":"Cities: How Do Some Birds Thrive There?","title_zh":"城市：鸟类为何能在此兴旺生存？","level":"B2","primary_topic":"psychology_science","tags":["science","ecology","birds","urban","frontiers"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":false,"summary_zh":"通常城市扩张会导致大型掠食动物消失，但在印度德里，猛禽黑鸢却出色地适应了人类环境并兴旺生存。生态学者在德里24个样地监测了154处黑鸢巢位，发现其食物与人类活动紧密相关：黑鸢既以街头垃圾为食，也利用居民宗教慈善投喂肉屑形成的稳定补给。GPS追踪显示亲鸟在巢周500米领地内频繁活动并定向造访投喂点；模型显示，选择在紧邻投喂点且林木繁茂处筑巢与更高的繁殖成效密切相关。这表明城市野生动物生存不仅取决于建筑道路，更取决于树木覆盖、垃圾管理与文化习俗如何交织维系生态。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-22T03:24:41Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"When ecologists examine how expanding cities affect wildlife, they usually observe that large predators disappear.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"当生态学家研究不断扩张的城市如何影响野生动物时，他们通常会观察到大型掠食动物相继消失。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":4,"surface":"When","lemma":"when","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"当……时"},{"start":5,"end":15,"surface":"ecologists","lemma":"ecologist","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"生态学家们"},{"start":16,"end":23,"surface":"examine","lemma":"examine","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"审视；研究"},{"start":24,"end":27,"surface":"how","lemma":"how","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"如何"},{"start":28,"end":37,"surface":"expanding","lemma":"expand","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"不断扩张的"},{"start":38,"end":44,"surface":"cities","lemma":"city","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"城市"},{"start":45,"end":51,"surface":"affect","lemma":"affect","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"影响"},{"start":52,"end":60,"surface":"wildlife","lemma":"wildlife","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"野生动物"},{"start":62,"end":66,"surface":"they","lemma":"they","pos":"人称代词","gloss_zh":"他们"},{"start":67,"end":74,"surface":"usually","lemma":"usually","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"通常"},{"start":75,"end":82,"surface":"observe","lemma":"observe","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"观察到"},{"start":83,"end":87,"surface":"that","lemma":"that","pos":"从属连词","gloss_zh":"引导宾语从句，通常不单独译出"},{"start":88,"end":93,"surface":"large","lemma":"large","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"大型的"},{"start":94,"end":103,"surface":"predators","lemma":"predator","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"掠食动物"},{"start":104,"end":113,"surface":"disappear","lemma":"disappear","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"消失"}],"phrases":[{"start":28,"end":44,"surface":"expanding cities","gloss_zh":"不断扩张的城市"},{"start":88,"end":103,"surface":"large predators","gloss_zh":"大型掠食动物"}]},{"id":"s2","text":"Roads, noise, and concrete structures destroy natural hunting grounds.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"道路、噪音和水泥混凝土建筑破坏了天然的捕食地。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":5,"surface":"Roads","lemma":"road","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"道路"},{"start":7,"end":12,"surface":"noise","lemma":"noise","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"噪音"},{"start":14,"end":17,"surface":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"以及"},{"start":18,"end":26,"surface":"concrete","lemma":"concrete","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"混凝土的"},{"start":27,"end":37,"surface":"structures","lemma":"structure","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"建筑物"},{"start":38,"end":45,"surface":"destroy","lemma":"destroy","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"破坏"},{"start":46,"end":53,"surface":"natural","lemma":"natural","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"天然的"},{"start":54,"end":61,"surface":"hunting","lemma":"hunting","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"捕食"},{"start":62,"end":69,"surface":"grounds","lemma":"ground","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"场地"}],"phrases":[{"start":18,"end":37,"surface":"concrete structures","gloss_zh":"混凝土建筑结构"},{"start":54,"end":69,"surface":"hunting grounds","gloss_zh":"捕食地"}]},{"id":"s3","text":"Yet in the megacity of Delhi, India, one bird of prey has adapted remarkably well to human surroundings: the black kite.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"然而在印度特大城市德里，一种猛禽却极其出色地适应了人类环境：那就是黑鸢。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":3,"surface":"Yet","lemma":"yet","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"然而"},{"start":4,"end":6,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在"},{"start":7,"end":10,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"定冠词","gloss_zh":"这个"},{"start":11,"end":19,"surface":"megacity","lemma":"megacity","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"特大城市"},{"start":20,"end":22,"surface":"of","lemma":"of","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"……这一"},{"start":23,"end":28,"surface":"Delhi","lemma":"Delhi","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"德里"},{"start":30,"end":35,"surface":"India","lemma":"India","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"印度"},{"start":37,"end":40,"surface":"one","lemma":"one","pos":"数词","gloss_zh":"一种"},{"start":41,"end":45,"surface":"bird","lemma":"bird","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"鸟类"},{"start":46,"end":48,"surface":"of","lemma":"of","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"……的"},{"start":49,"end":53,"surface":"prey","lemma":"prey","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"猎物"},{"start":54,"end":57,"surface":"has","lemma":"have","pos":"助动词","gloss_zh":"已经"},{"start":58,"end":65,"surface":"adapted","lemma":"adapt","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"适应"},{"start":66,"end":76,"surface":"remarkably","lemma":"remarkably","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"显著地；极其"},{"start":77,"end":81,"surface":"well","lemma":"well","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"好"},{"start":82,"end":84,"surface":"to","lemma":"to","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"对；适应于"},{"start":85,"end":90,"surface":"human","lemma":"human","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"人类的"},{"start":91,"end":103,"surface":"surroundings","lemma":"surroundings","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"周围环境"},{"start":105,"end":108,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"定冠词","gloss_zh":"定冠词（特指）"},{"start":109,"end":114,"surface":"black","lemma":"black","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"黑"},{"start":115,"end":119,"surface":"kite","lemma":"kite","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"鸢"}],"phrases":[{"start":41,"end":53,"surface":"bird of prey","gloss_zh":"猛禽"},{"start":66,"end":81,"surface":"remarkably well","gloss_zh":"极其出色地"},{"start":109,"end":119,"surface":"black kite","gloss_zh":"黑鸢"}]},{"id":"s4","text":"While many people think of raptors as fierce birds nesting only in remote forests, black kites live alongside millions of urban residents.","separator_after":"","translation_zh":"尽管许多人认为猛禽是只在偏远森林中筑巢的凶猛鸟类，黑鸢却与数百万城市居民共同生活在一起。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":5,"surface":"While","lemma":"while","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"尽管"},{"start":6,"end":10,"surface":"many","lemma":"many","pos":"限定词","gloss_zh":"许多"},{"start":11,"end":17,"surface":"people","lemma":"people","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"人们"},{"start":18,"end":23,"surface":"think","lemma":"think","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"认为；想（与 of ... as 构成搭配）"},{"start":24,"end":26,"surface":"of","lemma":"of","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"关于"},{"start":27,"end":34,"surface":"raptors","lemma":"raptor","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"猛禽"},{"start":35,"end":37,"surface":"as","lemma":"as","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"作为"},{"start":38,"end":44,"surface":"fierce","lemma":"fierce","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"凶猛的"},{"start":45,"end":50,"surface":"birds","lemma":"bird","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"鸟类"},{"start":51,"end":58,"surface":"nesting","lemma":"nest","pos":"动词现在分词","gloss_zh":"筑巢"},{"start":59,"end":63,"surface":"only","lemma":"only","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"仅仅"},{"start":64,"end":66,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在"},{"start":67,"end":73,"surface":"remote","lemma":"remote","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"偏远的"},{"start":74,"end":81,"surface":"forests","lemma":"forest","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"森林"},{"start":83,"end":88,"surface":"black","lemma":"black","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"黑"},{"start":89,"end":94,"surface":"kites","lemma":"kite","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"鸢"},{"start":95,"end":99,"surface":"live","lemma":"live","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"生活"},{"start":100,"end":109,"surface":"alongside","lemma":"alongside","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"与……共处"},{"start":110,"end":118,"surface":"millions","lemma":"million","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"数百万"},{"start":119,"end":121,"surface":"of","lemma":"of","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"……的"},{"start":122,"end":127,"surface":"urban","lemma":"urban","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"城市的"},{"start":128,"end":137,"surface":"residents","lemma":"resident","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"居民"}],"phrases":[{"start":18,"end":26,"surface":"think of","gloss_zh":"把……看作（think of ... as ...）"},{"start":67,"end":81,"surface":"remote forests","gloss_zh":"偏远森林"},{"start":83,"end":94,"surface":"black kites","gloss_zh":"黑鸢"},{"start":122,"end":137,"surface":"urban residents","gloss_zh":"城市居民"}]}]},{"sentences":[{"id":"s5","text":"To understand how these birds thrive in a crowded city, an ecological research team led by Nishant Kumar investigated kite nesting habits across Delhi.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"为了理解这些鸟类如何在拥挤的城市中兴旺生存，由尼尚特·库马尔带领的生态学研究团队调查了德里多处黑鸢的筑巢习性。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":2,"surface":"To","lemma":"to","pos":"不定式符号","gloss_zh":"为了"},{"start":3,"end":13,"surface":"understand","lemma":"understand","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"理解"},{"start":14,"end":17,"surface":"how","lemma":"how","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"如何"},{"start":18,"end":23,"surface":"these","lemma":"these","pos":"限定词","gloss_zh":"这些"},{"start":24,"end":29,"surface":"birds","lemma":"bird","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"鸟类"},{"start":30,"end":36,"surface":"thrive","lemma":"thrive","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"兴旺生存；茁壮成长"},{"start":37,"end":39,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在"},{"start":40,"end":41,"surface":"a","lemma":"a","pos":"不定冠词","gloss_zh":"一座"},{"start":42,"end":49,"surface":"crowded","lemma":"crowded","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"拥挤的"},{"start":50,"end":54,"surface":"city","lemma":"city","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"城市"},{"start":56,"end":58,"surface":"an","lemma":"an","pos":"不定冠词","gloss_zh":"一支"},{"start":59,"end":69,"surface":"ecological","lemma":"ecological","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"生态学的"},{"start":70,"end":78,"surface":"research","lemma":"research","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"研究"},{"start":79,"end":83,"surface":"team","lemma":"team","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"团队"},{"start":84,"end":87,"surface":"led","lemma":"lead","pos":"动词过去分词","gloss_zh":"带领"},{"start":88,"end":90,"surface":"by","lemma":"by","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"由"},{"start":91,"end":98,"surface":"Nishant","lemma":"Nishant","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"尼尚特"},{"start":99,"end":104,"surface":"Kumar","lemma":"Kumar","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"库马尔"},{"start":105,"end":117,"surface":"investigated","lemma":"investigate","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"调查了"},{"start":118,"end":122,"surface":"kite","lemma":"kite","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"黑鸢"},{"start":123,"end":130,"surface":"nesting","lemma":"nesting","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"筑巢"},{"start":131,"end":137,"surface":"habits","lemma":"habit","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"习性"},{"start":138,"end":144,"surface":"across","lemma":"across","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……多处；遍及"},{"start":145,"end":150,"surface":"Delhi","lemma":"Delhi","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"德里"}],"phrases":[{"start":59,"end":83,"surface":"ecological research team","gloss_zh":"生态学研究团队"},{"start":84,"end":90,"surface":"led by","gloss_zh":"由……带领"},{"start":123,"end":137,"surface":"nesting habits","gloss_zh":"筑巢习性"}]},{"id":"s6","text":"Between 2013 and 2016, the scientists surveyed 24 sampling plots of 100 hectares each, representing different urban environments from semi-natural parks to densely built neighborhoods.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"在2013至2016年间，科学家调查了24个面积各为100公顷的采样样地，涵盖了从半自然公园到建筑密集街区的不同城市环境。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":7,"surface":"Between","lemma":"between","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……之间"},{"start":13,"end":16,"surface":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"至；和"},{"start":23,"end":26,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"定冠词","gloss_zh":"这些"},{"start":27,"end":37,"surface":"scientists","lemma":"scientist","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"科学家们"},{"start":38,"end":46,"surface":"surveyed","lemma":"survey","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"调查了"},{"start":50,"end":58,"surface":"sampling","lemma":"sampling","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"采样"},{"start":59,"end":64,"surface":"plots","lemma":"plot","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"样地"},{"start":65,"end":67,"surface":"of","lemma":"of","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"面积为"},{"start":72,"end":80,"surface":"hectares","lemma":"hectare","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"公顷"},{"start":81,"end":85,"surface":"each","lemma":"each","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"各自"},{"start":87,"end":99,"surface":"representing","lemma":"represent","pos":"动词现在分词","gloss_zh":"代表着"},{"start":100,"end":109,"surface":"different","lemma":"different","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"不同的"},{"start":110,"end":115,"surf